	(gr_text "There are two large rectangles of F.Mask and B.Mask here to remove the front \nand back solder mask for a bare aluminium panel. \n\nIf you are making an FR4 panel, remove these large rectangles to you get solder mask.\nIf you want the symbols on the output jacks to be less visible (just 'embossed'),\nchange them from F.Silkscreen to F.Cu (or try F.Mask). \nIf you want the 'triggerspace' and 'semi-sensible synth' to look shiny, change their \nF.Silkscreen layer to F.Cu."
		(locked yes)
